  "id": "s2",
  "term": "S2",
  "definition": "S2 is an Encephalofluctuogram Technology (ET) spectral index derived from ultra-slow fluctuations in EEG activity. In ET research, it has been used as an indirect, model-based indicator interpreted as reflecting glutamatergic involvement rather than a direct measurement of glutamate.",
